al known as International Criminal 1412: the Phantom Thief, and that he was murdered by a mysterious organization for refusing to aid them in retrieving the \"Pandora Gem\"; a mystical stone said to shed a \"tear\" during the passing of a particular comet, the consumption of which bestows immortality. He vows to prevent the organization from gaining immortality, and assumes his father's identity as he begins his quest for the gem. His only clues as to the gem's location are that it glows red under the full moon and that it is a doublet: a gem hidden within a larger gem. Thus, it would have to be a relatively large one with a bizarre history, and always stored in a place that never receives moonlight. He thus researches and steals famous priceless gems with odd histories from incredibly well-defended areas, and always returns them after the very next full moon."},"tags":[{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Assassins","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Fugitive","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Magic","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Witch","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":63,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Police","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":48,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Detective","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Skateboarding","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Magic Kaito","english":null,"native":"まじっく快斗","romaji":"Magic Kaito","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"魔术快斗"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"名侦探柯南 怪盗基德特别篇"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"名探偵コナンスペシャル"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"夏の怪盗キッド祭り"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"怪盗キッドスペシャル"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Kaito Kid"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}